# GoBanqo PG Management System — Production Backend Technical Specification & Complete File Reference

## 1. Executive Summary & Architecture Overview

The **GoBanqo PG Management System Backend** (`pg-management-system-backend`) is a multi-tenant, cloud-native enterprise backend built on top of AWS Serverless Framework v4. It powers property management, tenant onboarding, financial tracking, automated billing, complaint resolution, legal/privacy compliance (GDPR/DPDP), web push notifications, and prepaid subscription management for Paying Guest (PG) owners and tenants.

### Core Architectural Stack
- **Compute & Serverless Core**: AWS Lambda (Node.js 20.x runtime, bundled via `esbuild`), Serverless Framework v4.40.
- **API Gateway & Routing**: AWS API Gateway REST APIs with custom Bearer Token Lambda Authorizer (`src/functions/auth/authorizer.js`).
- **Authentication & Identity**: AWS Cognito User Pools (Multi-role: `owner`, `tenant`, `admin`), with automated custom email/SMS verification and pre-signup triggers.
- **Database & Persistence**: AWS DynamoDB (Pay-Per-Request / On-Demand billing mode), with Global Secondary Indexes (GSIs), Point-in-Time Recovery (PITR), and DynamoDB Streams.
- **Object Storage & Encryption**: AWS S3 (KYC documents, property image uploads) with KMS envelope encryption (`AWS::KMS::Key`).
- **Payments & Subscriptions**: Razorpay Payment Gateway integration (orders, webhooks, signature verification) supporting 30-day trial and tiered annual subscription plans (Basic, Silver, Gold, Platinum).
- **Notifications**: AWS SES (Simple Email Service) with DKIM/SPF verification and Web Push (VAPID key-pair push notifications).
- **Infrastructure as Code & Stack Splitting**: Customized `serverless-plugin-split-stacks` (`splits.js`) distributing 550+ AWS CloudFormation resources across 4 domain-isolated nested stacks + 1 Root stack to prevent AWS CloudFormation 500-resource limits.

