## 2. Infrastructure as Code & CloudFormation Stack Architecture

To overcome AWS CloudFormation's 500-resource limit per stack, the project utilizes `serverless-plugin-split-stacks` with custom routing logic defined in `splits.js`.

```
                            ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
                            │                   Root Stack                    │
                            │  • API Gateway REST API, Resources & Methods    │
                            │  • Cognito User Pool & Client                   │
                            │  • Custom Lambda Authorizer                     │
                            │  • IAM Roles & Execution Policies               │
                            │  • KMS Master Keys & EventBridge Cron Rules     │
                            └────────────────────────┬────────────────────────┘
                                                     │
         ┌──────────────────────┬────────────────────┴────────────────────┬──────────────────────┐
         ▼                      ▼                                         ▼                      ▼
┌──────────────────┐  ┌──────────────────┐                     ┌──────────────────┐  ┌──────────────────┐
│   AppStack0      │  │   AppStack1      │                     │   AppStack2      │  │   AppStack3      │
│ (Auth & Privacy) │  │ (Properties &    │                     │(Tenant & Requests)│  │ (Financials &    │
│                  │  │     Rooms)       │                     │                  │  │  Subscriptions)  │
│ • 22 Functions   │  │ • 21 Functions   │                     │ • 21 Functions   │  │ • 29 Functions   │
│ • User Profiles  │  │ • Property CRUD  │                     │ • Tenant Check-In│  │ • Rent Collection│
│ • Policy Audit   │  │ • Room Management│                     │ • Tenant Portal  │  │ • Expenses       │
│ • GDPR/DPDP      │  │ • Image Upload   │                     │ • Requests/KYC   │  │ • Razorpay Sub.  │
│ • 5 Parameters   │  │ • 5 Parameters   │                     │ • 5 Parameters   │  │ • 5 Parameters   │
└──────────────────┘  └──────────────────┘                     └──────────────────┘  └──────────────────┘
```

### Stack Routing Rules (`splits.js`)
- **Root Stack**: Authorizer, RestApi, ApiGateway Resources & Methods, Deployments, IAM Roles, DynamoDB Tables, Cognito User Pool, S3 Buckets, KMS Keys, and Cron Background Jobs (`scheduledRentReminder`, `generateMonthlyBills`, `onTenantCreated`).
- **AppStack0 (Auth, Privacy & Legal)**: 22 Functions. User Signup, Login, Password Reset, Policy Compliance, Audit Logs, GDPR Consent & Data Erasure (`/auth/*`, `/privacy/*`, `/consent/*`).
- **AppStack1 (Properties & Rooms)**: 21 Functions. Property CRUD, Room Configuration, Bed Allocation, Image Upload URLs, Public Join Link validation (`/properties/*`, `/rooms/*`, `/upload/*`, `/invite-code/*`).
- **AppStack2 (Tenant & Request Operations)**: 21 Functions. Tenant Onboarding, Check-In/Check-Out, Agreement Signing, KYC Verification, Requests, Complaints (`/tenants/*`, `/tenant/*`, `/requests/*`, `/complaints/*`).
- **AppStack3 (Financials, Subscriptions & Notifications)**: 29 Functions. Owner Rent Billing, Expense Tracking, Razorpay Subscriptions, SES Email Events, Web Push (`/subscriptions/*`, `/financial/*`, `/notifications/*`, `/search/*`).

