## 3. Comprehensive File-by-File Directory Reference

### 3.1 Project Root Files

| File Name | Location | Description & Responsibilities |
|-----------|----------|--------------------------------|
| `serverless.yml` | `serverless.yml` | Core Serverless Framework specification (2197 lines). Defines 99+ Lambda functions, HTTP routes, CORS configurations, IAM execution roles, DynamoDB table schemas, S3 bucket settings, and KMS keys. |
| `splits.js` | `splits.js` | Custom CloudFormation stack splitting engine. Categorizes functions, log groups, and permissions into 4 nested stacks based on domain keywords to prevent cross-stack circular dependencies. |
| `package.json` | `package.json` | Node.js project manifest. Lists runtime dependencies (`@aws-sdk/client-cognito-identity-provider`, `aws-sdk`, `nodemailer`, `web-push`, `uuid`) and build dependencies (`serverless`, `serverless-esbuild`, `serverless-plugin-split-stacks`). |

