### 3.7 Function Handlers (`src/functions/`)

The 99 Lambda function handlers are organized by domain under `src/functions/`:

#### 1. Authentication & Security (`src/functions/auth/`, `src/functions/security/`)
- `authorizer.js`: Custom API Gateway token authorizer verifying JWT / DB user context.
- `signup.js`: Handles owner/tenant user registration with Cognito.
- `login.js`: Authenticates credentials against Cognito and issues access tokens.
- `refreshToken.js`: Issues new access tokens from a valid refresh token.
- `logout.js`: Invalidates user sessions and push tokens.
- `forgotPassword.js` & `confirmForgotPassword.js`: Password reset flow.
- `verifyEmail.js` & `resendVerification.js`: Account verification email handler.
- `verifyToken.js` & `verifyInvitationToken.js`: Validates secure invitation links.
- `activateAccount.js`: Completes tenant account setup from email invitation.
- `getProfile.js` & `updateProfile.js`: Reads and updates user profile data.
- `createAdmin.js`: Admin-only handler for bootstrapping administrative users.
- `cognitoPreSignUp.js` & `cognitoCustomMessage.js`: Cognito custom triggers for user validation and email customization.
- `getAuditLogs.js`: Fetches administrative audit trails for compliance.

#### 2. Legal Policy & Privacy Compliance (`src/functions/privacy/`)
- `getLatestPolicies.js`: Returns active terms of service and privacy policy versions.
- `acceptPolicies.js`: Records user policy acceptance in audit logs.
- `getPolicyHistory.js`: Returns audit trail of user accepted policy revisions.
- `getConsent.js` & `updateConsent.js`: Manages user marketing/data processing consents.
- `exportData.js`: Generates a downloadable JSON export of all personal data (GDPR/DPDP right to access).
- `requestErasure.js`: Initiates data deletion process (GDPR/DPDP right to be forgotten).

#### 3. Property & Room Management (`src/functions/property/`)
- `addProperty.js`, `getProperties.js`, `getPropertyById.js`, `updateProperty.js`, `deleteProperty.js`: Property CRUD.
- `activatePropertyManagement.js`: Toggles property active status.
- `createImageUploadUrls.js`: Issues S3 presigned upload URLs for property photos.
- `addRoom.js`, `bulkAddRooms.js`, `getRooms.js`, `getRoomById.js`, `updateRoom.js`, `deleteRoom.js`: Room & Bed CRUD.
- `generateInviteCode.js`, `getInviteCode.js`, `validateInviteCode.js`: Management of property join codes.
- `getPublicPropertyInvite.js`, `getPublicAvailableRooms.js`, `submitPublicJoinRequest.js`: Public-facing tenant join portal.

#### 4. Tenant Operations & Onboarding (`src/functions/tenant/`)
- `inviteTenant.js`: Sends invitation email to prospective tenant with secure activation token.
- `checkInTenant.js`: Formally checks in tenant, assigns room/bed, and generates initial rent record.
- `resendInvitation.js`: Re-issues activation token email for pending tenants.
- `getTenants.js`, `getTenantById.js`, `updateTenant.js`: Tenant profile management.
- `checkOutTenant.js`: Processes tenant check-out, releases bed allocation, and calculates deposit refund.
- `migrateTenant.js`: Transfers tenant from one room/bed to another within the property.
- `uploadKYC.js`: Presigned URL creation for tenant identity document uploads (Aadhaar/PAN/Passport).
- `getRoomStatus.js`: Returns real-time occupancy map of property rooms.
- `discoverProperties.js`: Public search endpoint for tenants seeking available PG rooms.
- `createBookingRequest.js`: Tenant endpoint for requesting room reservations.
- `signAgreement.js`: Electronic agreement signature recorder.
- `payRent.js`: Tenant self-service rent payment confirmation.
- `savePushSubscription.js` & `deletePushSubscription.js`: Web Push subscription registration.
- `linkTenantProperty.js`: Associates an existing tenant account with a property.
- `getTenantDashboard.js`: Aggregated summary dashboard for logged-in tenants.

#### 5. Requests & Complaints (`src/functions/requests/`, `src/functions/complaints/`)
- `getRequests.js`, `updateRequestStatus.js`, `bulkApproveRequests.js`, `bulkDeleteRequests.js`: Management of tenant join and maintenance requests.
- `createComplaint.js`, `getComplaints.js`, `updateComplaintStatus.js`: Resolution ticket workflow for tenant issues.

#### 6. Financial Management & Billing (`src/functions/financial/`)
- `collectRent.js`: Owner endpoint to manually record offline rent receipts.
- `generateMonthlyBills.js`: Automated background job generating upcoming month rent bills.
- `getRentPayments.js`, `updatePayment.js`: Payment history and status tracking.
- `addExpense.js`, `getExpenses.js`, `updateExpense.js`, `deleteExpense.js`: Property operational expense tracker.
- `generateReport.js`: Financial summary analytics (Revenue vs Expenses).
- `sendReminder.js` & `scheduledRentReminder.js`: Manual and automated rent payment reminders.
- `testSmtpCredentials.js`: Validates custom SMTP server settings.
- `getReminderSettings.js` & `updateReminderSettings.js`: Reminder schedule configurations.

#### 7. Prepaid Subscriptions & Razorpay (`src/functions/subscription/`)
- `getStatus.js`: Returns current property owner subscription tier and expiry.
- `startTrial.js`: Grants 30-day free trial for new property owners.
- `createCheckout.js`: Creates a Razorpay Order for annual prepaid plan purchase.
- `verifyCheckout.js`: Verifies Razorpay payment signature and updates owner subscription tier in DynamoDB.
- `webhook.js`: Razorpay webhook listener for asynchronous payment events (`payment.captured`, `order.paid`).

#### 8. Notifications & Global Search (`src/functions/notifications/`, `src/functions/search/`)
- `getNotifications.js`, `markRead.js`, `markAllRead.js`, `markUnread.js`, `deleteNotification.js`: In-app notification mailbox handlers.
- `getNotificationLogs.js`: System delivery log viewer.
- `sesEventHandler.js`: Webhook listener for SES email delivery bounces and complaints.
- `getVapidPublicKey.js`: Returns public VAPID key for Web Push client subscription.
- `onTenantCreated.js`: Background event handler dispatching welcome notifications upon tenant creation.
- `broadcastEmail.js`: Admin/Owner endpoint for sending bulk email announcements.
- `globalSearch.js`: Multi-entity search engine (`src/functions/search/globalSearch.js`).

